  "title": "Point Grey Luxury | 4BR+5BA | Elevator, Rooftop Deck & HotTub | Now - apartments / housing for rent - craigslist",
  "bodyText": "CL\n\nvancouver, BC >\n\nvancouver >\n\nhousing >\n\napartments / housing for rent\n\npost\naccount\nreply \nfavorite\n \nhide\n \n⚐\nflag\n \n\nshare\n\nPosted 4 days ago\n\nprint\n$15,000 / 4br - 4000ft2 - Point Grey Luxury | 4BR+5BA | Elevator, Rooftop Deck & HotTub | Now (West Point Grey)\n4588 W 2nd Ave, Vancouver, BC V6R1K9\n© craigslist - Map data © OpenStreetMap\n4588 W 2nd Ave near Tolmie St\n\ngoogle map\n\n4BR / 5Ba 4000ft2 available now\nrent period: monthly\nhouse\nw/d in unit\ndetached garage\nno smoking\nProperty Details:\n\nProperty ID: 5585 LU\nLocation: 4588 West 2nd Avenue, Vancouver\nRent: $15,000/mo\nAvailability: Now\nFurnished: No\nBedroom: 4 Bedroom\nBathroom: 5 Bathroom\nSize of Area: 4,000 sqft\nPet: No\nParking: Detached Garage\nUtilities: Not Included\nLease Term: Minimum lease term 12 months required\n\n\n\nDescription:\nExperience refined West Coast living in this custom-built luxury residence by renowned builder Brandes, quietly tucked in Point Grey’s prestigious North of 4th pocket. Designed around a thoughtful reverse floor plan, the home elevates daily living with an open-concept main floor boasting soaring 11'+ vaulted ceilings and sweeping, uninterrupted water views. A private elevator seamlessly serves all three levels, providing effortless access throughout. Crafted for the culinary enthusiast and entertainer alike, the residence features a chef's kitchen fitted with premium Sub-Zero and Wolf appliances, honed granite counters, custom millwork, an expansive wine cellar, and a private home theater. Step outside to an entertainment-scale rooftop deck complete with a private hot tub and dramatic 360-degree views of the ocean, mountains, and city skyline. Appointed with custom stone, marble, and full high-tech home automation, this unfurnished 4-bedroom, 5-bathroom sanctuary effortlessly blends classic architectural warmth with modern sophistication—all just steps from Spanish Banks, Jericho Beach, UBC, and top-tier school catchments, including Lord Byng Secondary and Queen Mary Elementary.\n\n\n\nPlease reply to this ad to arrange your private viewing or inquire about the house.\nPlease include your personal contact information for us to be able to assist you with your inquiry more promptly.\n\n\n\n\n** Professionally managed and marketed by Vancouver Luxury Realty. VLR does not charge prospective tenants any handling fees, application fees or processing fees. We are fully licensed with the Real Estate Council of British Columbia and simply act as the landlord/marketer for the owner. **\n\n**Any storage locker and parking stall measurement/size to be verified by prospective tenants if applicable.**\n\nMore info visit us @ www.vancouverluxuryrentals.com\n\n\npost id: 7991000502\n\n \n\nposted: 4 days ago\n\n \n\nupdated: about 22 hours ago\n\n \n\n♥ best of [?]\n\nhelp\nsafety\nprivacy\nterms\nabout\napp\n© 2026 craigslist",
